WEBVTT

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:35.830
So you didn’t take this one to the old man’s place?

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:37.660
He’s under us, right?

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:38.960
Mm-hmm.

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:42.750
We’re taking on a vassal, so he’ll be taken care of soon.

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:53.920
You look pale.

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:57.110
So do you, Yaichi-dono.

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:02.040
So you’re cleaning your sword for this job?

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:06.000
I do not intend to use my sword for work related to the Five Leaves.

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:09.970
Didn’t you say that you’ll protect me?

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:12.830
Only if I use the back of my sword.

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:18.990
What do you need?

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:22.340
To discuss this job.

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:24.900
We kidnapped the son of the vassal, right?

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:32.360
They’re planning to give us the money the day after tomorrow.

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:34.130
Understood.

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:42.590
So the Five Leaves is really going to disband after this job?

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:47.250
Maybe. However, I don’t need the money anymore.

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:50.980
I just want to live a comfortable life.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:56.860
You must need the money, Masa, but you’re going to have to earn it yourself.

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:04.930
I just don’t see the purpose for Ichi to have you all still be doing jobs for the Five Leaves.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:09.110
I’m wondering about that as well.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:15.850
To hear what you’ve kept to yourselves for a while coming straight from your mouths...

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:20.590
It’s bad manners to say something that’s already understood.

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:26.050
But if you don’t say what you think, you can never settle the matter.

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:34.210
I have felt a bit uneasy with the Five Leaves for some time.

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:37.680
Masa, that’s also bad manners.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:41.090
Pardon my rudeness.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:44.990
Pardon My Rudeness

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:48.510
What kind of house are we looking for?

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:50.490
You didn’t hear?

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:52.350
A vassal’s house?

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:55.780
The House of Kanou. We kidnapped their eldest son.

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:58.700
We’ve had them prepare more money than we usually ask.

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:04.640
I’ve already told you that I go after vassals because they are easy targets.

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:09.460
Do I need any other reason than that?

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:41.430
I will leave the money at my feet and leave. Is that okay with you?

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:45.660
They’ve prepared half the money you requested.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:48.840
You don’t need to give us back the hostage.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:55.090
Consider this your payment. You will dispose of the hostage in private.

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:59.100
If this becomes public due to carelessness,

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:03.380
your names will appear in the newspaper, Five Leaves.

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:07.470
What’s the reason?

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:09.770
Reason?

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:13.230
The reason for disposing of him in private.

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:18.850
Since he does not share his father’s blood, he is not the true heir.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.550
Tavern

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:31.990
So he’s adopted, huh?
Well, he is certainly the heir.

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:35.790
So what do they mean about him not sharing his father’s blood?

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:38.280
Wouldn’t that mean he was conceived through adultery?

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:41.010
Between the wife and another man.

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:44.610
They may act like he’s the eldest son,

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.420
but maybe the husband doesn’t see him that way.

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:50.460
In any case, we have to do something about him.

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:52.900
Maybe we can send him back without exposing anything.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.400
But will that resolve anything?

00:05:55.800 --> 00:06:00.650
Still, that’s a sorry tale. Not being wanted by your own home.

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:03.080
How pitiful.

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:06.930
We can’t have him coming to his senses. Should we drug him again, Ichi?

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:21.460
Who’s there?

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:23.760
You’ve been kidnapped.

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:25.890
I... I was?

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:29.940
Your parents didn’t pay your ransom.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:37.970
Instead, they paid us money to murder you in secret.

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:39.480
It can’t be.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:42.490
So that family didn’t want you?

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:44.170
That can’t be!

00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:51.800
My father prepared that money for me!

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:54.260
It can’t be for anything else!

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:15.310
Why did he have to say that? It wasn’t even necessary.

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:30.490
That was funny.

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:42.530
What if Yaichi-dono wanted to see that child...

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:49.320
What if the Five Leaves... and the kidnappings... were not for the money,

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:51.920
but because he wanted to witness those scenes?

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:56.230
The vassal’s heir was an old friend of Yagi-dono

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:59.010
and supposedly died from an illness.

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:05.640
Yaichi-dono himself was kidnapped.

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:24.390
It’s been a while. You’ve sure grown.

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:30.090
He belongs to an old friend.

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:33.560
He’s waiting for Toku-san to arrive.

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:45.410
So how did you deal with that boy?

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:48.390
We released him in the woods where no one could see him.

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:53.720
What happened after that is his problem. Ichi told us to do that.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:59.500
Ichi is getting harder and harder to understand.

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.170
The Five Leaves will end with this.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:07.310
I can’t say what he’s going to do from now on, but this can’t continue.

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:09.640
The food is ready.

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.320
I’ll go call the man outside.

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:13.430
Right.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.600
I’m not hungry.

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:22.170
Don’t be shy.

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:23.810
I’m not.

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:29.030
He left a crew back when he was younger.

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:32.030
This is Umezou and his daughter Okinu.

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:39.230
I am Jin, and I have been receiving the mercy of The Buddha for the past few days.

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:41.960
Do you live in Edo?

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:46.210
Yeah. I’m able to eat through my own efforts alone.

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:49.900
I have no talents other than my raw strength.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:07.230
Daddy, why didn’t you tell him about our shop?

00:10:08.410 --> 00:10:11.160
He... gives me a bad feeling.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:15.870
Take a meal break.

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:22.400
He’s been out of the game for ten or so years.

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:25.000
He’s detached from what goes on here.

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:27.980
He probably wouldn’t know about the Bakuro if you asked him.

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:31.300
Well, that was why I did ask.

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:34.130
If he knows anything about Seinoshin or not...

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:40.220
If The Buddha doesn’t know, why should he?

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:51.990
Yaichi-dono.

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:58.110
He asked if we released the boy like he said.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:08.290
Why are you following me?

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:17.030
This is not the way to Katsuraya.

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:25.910
Perhaps you’re planning to go to the House of Kanou?

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:28.910
There’s something I need to ascertain.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:32.530
What’s the reason behind that need?

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:34.970
What do you mean?

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:36.540
Uh... well...

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:37.960
Go home!

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:40.740
Yaichi-dono.

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:43.620
What?

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:50.980
Sei.

00:12:00.450 --> 00:12:03.360
Samurai. This does not involve you.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:07.920
I made a promise to protect Yaichi-dono.

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:09.070
Yaichi?

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:16.590
Samurai. Are you certain that you know the man you vowed to protect?

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:24.530
The next time we meet, I shall settle these affairs.

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:29.280
As the last member of the Bakuro.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:38.660
The family headship was transferred to my younger brother.

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:41.940
My uncle, the castle retainer,

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:46.190
recommended me for duty at the daimyo’s residence in Edo, so I went.

00:12:47.150 --> 00:12:52.900
But I began to wonder if being there was the right choice.

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:57.920
“I want to change.” was what I wished for myself.

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:02.290
Then, I became determined to leave the fiefdom.

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:05.310
Once I achieved that, I aimed to become a full samurai again.

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:09.660
But as the days passed, I began to question if I could fulfill that dream.

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:14.830
Encountering the Five Leaves has certainly kept me fed.

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:19.420
Forget about the past. Enjoy the present.

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:23.740
The man who sits right before me taught me that.

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:25.050
Yaichi-dono.

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:31.050
Did you persuade yourself to become as you are?

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:32.170
What did you say?

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:36.550
What is the Five Leaves to you?

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:41.210
Are you the one who is living in the past?

00:13:54.780 --> 00:14:00.890
I wanted to talk about myself before going to the old man’s place.

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:04.680
Yaichi-dono, I’ve wanted to find out more about you,

00:14:04.680 --> 00:14:08.220
but I thought I must first reveal my own self.

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:16.310
Up until today, I thought it was best to be ignorant of your affairs.

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:20.320
But now I do wish to know.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:24.330
So I’m going to question the old man.

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:27.270
I’m going without any hesitation.

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:36.260
I believe this is another lesson I learned from you, Yaichi-dono.

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:45.200
There is... one thing I need to share with you.

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:50.430
Yaichi-dono. The location of your grave.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:08.290
Concerning the Yaichi that I knew, I first met him when I was still a boss of our crew.

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:10.520
But I met him only once.

00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:14.360
Please tell me more.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:30.150
Take out all the money you have!

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:34.810
And also all your clothes, if you value your life!

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:36.520
Do you hear us?

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:40.040
You night-thieving monkeys screech too loudly!

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.170
Don’t provoke them.

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:43.340
Do as we say now!

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:45.570
We don’t have money! Go away!

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:49.030
Just give us the money you have, and we’ll leave!

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:52.120
Hey!

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:01.040
Boss!

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:02.630
Boss.

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:06.880
Come on, give us the money and go.

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:14.090
You monkeys. This is a boss of the Ishi crew, Souji the Buddha!

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:15.860
Ishi?

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:22.980
So how are you going to pay for wounding Souji?

00:16:23.590 --> 00:16:28.490
Kuhei-san of Bakuro, do you think we’ll just accept your assertion

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:33.350
that your underlings were merely acting on their own?

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:36.890
I apologize.

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:40.770
They did it impulsively without realizing he was a boss of Ishi.

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:44.160
It seems that you can’t train your boys in night thievery.

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:46.130
Well, if we’re talking about the Bakuro,

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:50.610
you’re all too stupid to handle even easy jobs and just do smash-and-grabs instead.

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:55.080
Well, what’s on top always flows to the bottom. And how.

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:56.130
Benzou.

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:57.660
You be quiet.

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:04.390
So are you going to show us what makes you the boss of this crew?

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:11.680
Boss.

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:15.770
I’m sorry.

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:21.020
Ryuu is like a younger brother to me, but I couldn’t control him.

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:22.890
I’ll join him in punishment.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:27.920
So please, forgive him, bosses of Ishi.

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:30.630
The other one ran away.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:34.410
You probably won’t consider the fact that he stayed put.

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:38.070
Me too! Have me share his punishment as his brother!

00:17:38.400 --> 00:17:40.140
But please spare his life.

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:44.430
You’re making me cry, Kuhei-san.

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:45.540
Benzou.

00:17:47.990 --> 00:17:51.160
Shall we have him take responsibility by losing a finger?

00:17:52.810 --> 00:17:54.520
Just that will suffice.

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:57.630
And that’s why he’s called The Buddha.

00:17:58.150 --> 00:18:03.200
Be glad your crew gets to walk away with your meager numbers still intact.

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:05.670
Although he’ll be losing a finger...

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:08.780
Sei.

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:11.200
Oh. Boss, I’ll...

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:15.090
It’ll be Sei. We don’t need to worry about you carrying it out.

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:18.100
We’ll have the youngest one mete out the punishment.

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:21.280
Sei, have him take responsibility!

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:31.150
What about a dagger...?

00:18:32.050 --> 00:18:34.070
I’m not used to one.

00:18:59.760 --> 00:19:00.600
Sei!

00:19:19.390 --> 00:19:22.700
So it’s settled. Are you satisfied?

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:24.890
Let’s have some sake.

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:36.170
That’s enough.

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:40.160
The Buddha gave us his mercy, so why?!

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:40.950
Monji!

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:44.110
You are not a little brother!

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:47.240
He said to have him take responsibility.

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:50.350
Are we to oppose our boss?

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:02.730
At least show some hesitation when doing it.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:13.750
Thank you, Boss Buddha, for giving us your mercy.

00:20:14.290 --> 00:20:16.290
He was like a brother to you?

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:19.860
Yes, Ryuu certainly was, and also Monji.

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:22.470
And that Sei?

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:25.800
He is... also a younger brother.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:59.690
To be

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:59.690
continued

00:21:08.520 --> 00:21:15.720
I’ve got a feeling that something was hidden

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:25.010
in the words you once told me. Those words cross my mind again and again.

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:33.430
Yet your voice always sounds the same as before.

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:40.480
Every time I breathe, I wanna hold you in my arms

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:49.410
Every words you whispered makes my heart beat up and high

00:21:50.250 --> 00:21:57.490
Every time I breathe, I just wanna hold you in my arms again

00:21:58.610 --> 00:22:06.310
Every words you whispered makes my heart beat up and high

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:14.550
Every day I need you  All the time I'll be there for you

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:23.660
Every words you whispered makes my heart beat up and high

00:22:29.960 --> 00:22:32.950
Next time on House of Five Leaves:

00:22:33.380 --> 00:22:36.200
I am the cat who lives in Nagaya with Masa.

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:38.890
I’ve grown purr-ty fat lately.

00:22:38.890 --> 00:22:43.750
Otake-san ate katsuobushi right along with me, so why only me?

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:45.670
Meow, I need to lose weight.

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:47.720
Well then, the next episode’s title is:

00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:49.680
“I’m Already Tipsy.”
